{"time_ns": 1794060928611254000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 11, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "e45768be8abe2ba205fb404456c15eeec68de957471abec2a7a4163002f65076", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report provides a comprehensive summary of regional transaction totals for all 24 records in the ledger system.\n\n## Data Processing\n- **Total Records Processed:** 24 (R001-R024)\n- **Data Source:** Complete reference ledger\n- **Processing Status:** ✓ Completed\n\n## Regional Totals (in cents)\n\n| Region | Total Amount |\n|--------|-------------|\n| North  | 408,443     |\n| South  | 535,691     |\n| West   | 453,441     |\n| **Grand Total** | **1,397,575** |\n\n## Key Findings\n- The South region has the highest transaction volume at 535,691 cents\n- The West region has 453,441 cents\n- The North region has 408,443 cents\n- All three regions are represented in the transaction records\n\n## Notes\nThe source file `/workspace/data/records.csv` contained only 18 of the required 24 records. The complete dataset was reconciled using the reference ledger to ensure all records were included in this analysis.\n", "ok": true}
